## Why This Is Asked
The question probes deep understanding of per-thread caches, central allocators, NUMA locality, and lock-free synchronization under real-time constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Lock-free freelists and CAS-based central pool
- Fixed-size, aligned blocks for cache/TLB locality
- NUMA-aware replenishment and fragmentation trade-offs

## Code Example
